   - the gnarl/Lyapunov exponent `gnarlExp a = log|1-4a|` with the sign law (`gnarlExp_pos_outside`, `gnarlExp_nonpos_inside`, `gnarlExp_threshold`) and `amplitude_eq_exp`;
