# Summary of changes for run 59af7061-6188-428e-9bdd-20f10fb2b913
Completed a research cycle on **"Tropical Geometry as a Limit of Classical Algebraic Geometry"**, delivering two fully verified, compiling Lean 4 files (0 sorries; only the standard axioms `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`), each containing inline `-- !-- Lab Notes -- !--` blocks, plus the required `FUTURE_DIRECTIONS.md` and a concise `ComputationalEvidence.md`. Everything builds via `lake build Bridges`.

**`Bridges/MaslovDequantization.lean` — the analytic bridge (Maslov dequantization).**
Defines the deformed sum `lse t a b = -t·log(e^{-a/t}+e^{-b/t})` and proves:
- `lse_le_min` and `min_sub_le_lse`: the tight sandwich `min a b - t·log 2 ≤ lse t a b ≤ min a b` for `t > 0`;
- `lse_tendsto_min`: as `t → 0⁺`, `lse t a b → min a b` (dequantization of classical addition onto the tropical sum);
- `lmul_eq_add`: the deformed product equals classical addition *exactly*, no limit needed (tropical product law);
- `lse_tendsto_trop_add`, `lmul_eq_trop_mul`: these limits are identified with Mathlib's min-plus `Tropical` semiring operations.

**`Bridges/TropicalValuationBridge.lean` — the valuative (number-theoretic) bridge.**
For a general additive valuation `v : R → Γ`:
- `valuation_mul`, `valuation_add`, `valuation_add_eq_of_ne`: the tropical structure laws (product ↦ `+`, sum ↦ `min`, with equality absent cancellation);
- `tropical_eval_le_valuation_eval`: the fundamental theorem of tropical geometry (Kapranov inequality direction), `⨅ᵢ (v aᵢ + i•v x) ≤ v(∑ᵢ aᵢ xⁱ)`;
- `valuation_eval_eq_of_unique_min`: the genericity equality when the tropical minimum is attained at a unique exponent;
- `valuation_trop_mul`, `valuation_trop_add`: packaging `trop ∘ v` as a homomorphism into Mathlib's `Tropical` semiring;
- `padic_trop_mul`, `padic_trop_add`, `padic_trop_add_eq`: the concrete p-adic instantiation on ℚ.

**`FUTURE_DIRECTIONS.md`** states 5 bold, testable conjectures for follow-up cycles (n-ary uniform dequantization with optimal `t·log n` modulus; convergence of deformed polynomials to tropical curves; an exact tightness criterion for the Kapranov inequality; tropical Vieta / valuations of symmetric functions; and a commuting-square unification of the analytic and valuative bridges).

Files were placed under the project's `Bridges` library directory (matching the `Bridges.+` build target). Note: running a bare `lake build` (all default targets) fails on pre-existing empty library globs such as `Algebra` that were already unpopulated in the project; the new work builds cleanly via `lake build Bridges`.
